OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785179923
OL,3,CLaw student accused of transporting
OL,4,Cbomb into Northern Ireland further
OL,5,Cremanded
OL,7,FA law student accused of transporting
OL,8,Fa bomb across Ireland has been
OL,9,Fremanded in custody with consent to
OL,10,Fbail.
OL,12,FIsobella Perrie Sullivan, 25, of
OL,13,FAbbeylands Park, Clane, Co Kildare,
OL,14,Fappeared wearing a white-coloured T-
OL,15,Fshirt with the logo "faith over fear"
OL,16,Fvia video link from the Dochas Centre
OL,17,F(female prison) in Dublin before
OL,18,FMonaghan District Court on Monday
OL,19,Fmorning.
OL,26,@wD@UOUwD@eO]
