PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785179923
OL,3,CLaw student accused of transporting
OL,4,Cbomb into Northern Ireland further
OL,5,Cremanded
OL,7,FShe was charged with possession of
OL,8,Fexplosives at a special sitting of
OL,9,FTrim District Court in Co Meath on
OL,10,FFriday evening after a bomb was
OL,11,Fintercepted in a car near the Irish
OL,12,Fborder.
OL,14,FHer defence solicitor said she had
OL,15,Fbeen asked to take a bag to the north
OL,16,Fand had not been aware was in it,
OL,17,Fadding she had been "manipulated".
OL,26,@yD@UOUyD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785179923
OL,3,CLaw student accused of transporting
OL,4,Cbomb into Northern Ireland further
OL,5,Cremanded
OL,7,FShe was then granted bail with a host
OL,8,Fof conditions which included a 15,000-
OL,9,Feuro independent surety, that she
OL,10,Fsurrenders her passport, stays at an
OL,11,Faddress approved by Gardai with a
OL,12,Fcurfew of 9pm to 7am, has a mobile
OL,13,Fphone available 24/7 and signs in each
OL,14,Fday to Naas garda station.
OL,16,FGardai also requested another
OL,17,Fcondition, that she not have any
OL,18,Fcontact with anyone in the Saoradh
OL,19,Fpolitical party or the New IRA.
OL,26,@sD@ZrtxD@Frt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
