PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785179923
OL,3,CLaw student accused of transporting
OL,4,Cbomb into Northern Ireland further
OL,5,Cremanded
OL,7,FOn Monday at Monaghan District Court,
OL,8,FJudge Raymond Finnegan heard that her
OL,9,Fdefence lawyer was not present in
OL,10,Fcourt and said she would be remanded
OL,11,Fwith consent to bail.
OL,13,FMs Perrie Sullivan put to the judge:
OL,14,F"I thought I was getting out today
OL,15,Fwith bail."
OL,17,FThe judge said that he had not
OL,18,Freceived an application to approve the
OL,19,Fsurety.
OL,26,@vD@AOUwD@KO]
