OL,3,CLaw student accused of transporting
OL,4,Cbomb into Northern Ireland further
OL,5,Cremanded
OL,7,FA Garda officer told the court they
OL,8,Fare still making inquiries in terms of
OL,9,Fthe surety.
OL,11,FShe is next set to appear before
OL,12,FMonaghan District Court on August 7.
